re or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. Boston University, consistent with the AAU’s Principles on Preventing Sexual Harassment, conducts background checks for ﬁnal candidates for certain faculty and staff positions. As part of this process, we ask current and past employers of the last seven years whether there has been a substantiated ﬁnding of sexual misconduct under their policies. To move forward, ﬁnal candidates must complete and sign an “Authorization to Release Information” form after receiving an offer to enable this background check. This position is located in Boston, MA. View the Google Map in full screen . Apply close"
